error[E0277]: `(Decl, (Elem, (Other, Junk)))` cannot implement a sealed Verum trait
  --> tests/ui/compile_fail/has_forged_membership_at_depth_on_malformed_set.rs:31:9
   |
31 |     for (Decl, (Elem, (Other, Junk)))
   |         ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ not sealed by Verum
